+#   llama.cpp      the `--reasoning-budget N` BOOT flag, and NO such line. The
+#                  shipped composes emit it as `${REASONING_BUDGET:-32768}`
+#                  (32768 has been the qwen3.8 llama.cpp default since #1617), so
+#                  the flag being PRESENT proves nothing: its RESOLVED value is
